@crew v-jaramillo-ulla
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello! Ulla. I play lounges. Hum me something. Anything.
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hi. Passing through. Is the bow lounge always this cosy?
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I turned your hello into a tune. It's in three-four.   #funny
?

== chat
- Every ship hums a different note. The Wren's a low G. Very calm.
- I call home after every show. They ask if anyone clapped. Somebody always does.

== near
? place:lounge
- Best room I've played all season. The windows do half the work.
? habit:stargazer
- Stars after a show. That's the encore I like.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If you hear a tune tonight, that was you.

== smalltalk
- Hum it. I'll play it.   #funny
- The Wren's a low G.
